  "description": "Welcome Interstate Managers is the third studio album by the American rock band Fountains of Wayne. It was released by S-Curve Records on June 10, 2003. The album garnered the band breakthrough success into the mainstream, containing the power pop single \"Stacy's Mom,\" which reached number 21 on the US Billboard Hot 100, becoming the band's highest-charting hit in the United States. Two more singles were released from the album: \"Mexican Wine\" and \"Hey Julie\".",
